      "source": "mixed",
      "promptMarkdown": "./feedback.json is the raw response of the pr-review skill's step 6 GraphQL\nquery for PR 412. It is large, so do not read it into this conversation —\ndelegate the extraction to the `locator` agent.\n\nApply step 6's channel rules to what comes back and produce the surviving\nitems only.\n\nOutput one line per surviving item and nothing else — no preamble, no\nsummary, no counts:\n\n    <id> | <author> | <path>:<line> | OUTDATED or CURRENT | <first sentence of the body>\n\nFor an inline thread <id> is the thread id, not the id of a comment inside\nit — the thread id is what a reply later has to be posted against. For a\nreview or a PR-level comment it is that record's own id.\n\nUse `n/a` for path and line where the channel has none. Do not print the id\nof any item you dropped.\n",
      "runsPerCase": 3,
      "timeoutSeconds": 900,
      "maxTurns": 25,
      "graders": [
